CHANGES MADE
=============
1. Makefile.web:
   - Added gmake requirement and GMAKE variable
   - Changed CPP to "emcc -E -P -x c" for .h.in preprocessing
   - Inner make uses $(GMAKE) --no-builtin-rules
   - Added gmake version check to web target

2. src/engine/math_util.c:
   - Added #include <float.h> for FLT_EPSILON

3. src/pc/loading.h:
   - Added #ifdef TARGET_WEB branch for LOADING_SCREEN_MUTEX macro
   - Web version executes code without mutex (single-threaded)

4. src/pc/audio/audio_web.h:
   - Replaced EM_ASM({...}) with emscripten_run_script() string API
   - Avoids preprocessor comma confusion in JavaScript code

POST-FIX BUILD RESULTS (Build #2)
===================================
